# The repository is LF-only, and the whole tree was LF before this file existed.
#
# Without it, a Windows checkout writes CRLF into every file an editor touches,
# `core.autocrlf=false` commits the CR as content, and `git diff --check` — which
# the agent contract requires to pass — reports every added line as trailing
# whitespace. This normalizes on commit and leaves the working copy alone.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never touch.
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
